{"step_index":1982,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-03T08:32:22Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nREFACTOR: REMOVE INLINE TAX CARD AND BUILD STORED BILLS TAX LEDGER TAB\n\n1. CLEAN UP TAB 1 (Invoice Math Audit):\n- Completely delete/unmount the dark card at the bottom right: \"Tax & ITR Insights Sec 44AD Presumptive\" along with the 3 pills, digital receipts slider, and the Gemini tax callout.\n- Keep only:\n  * Live Tax Invoice Preview (left)\n  * Audit Verdict & Diff cards (top right)\n  * Bill Header Inputs (Supplier Name, GSTIN, Billed Grand Total)\n  * Item Breakdown & Math Check table\n  * GST Tax Rate & Split box\n  * Action buttons ([📋 Copy Note], [📲 WhatsApp], [📑 CA Audit Slip])\n- Add an explicit button in the action bar:\n  [💾 Save Bill to Tax Ledger]\n  Clicking this saves the current verified bill into local/indexed storage (or backend DB) and updates the ledger.\n\n2. BUILD TAB 2 (Tax & ITR Filing) AS AN ACCUMULATIVE LEDGER & TAX ENGINE:\nWhen switching to the \"📊 Tax & ITR Filing\" tab, display a full business ledger instead of an inline single-invoice card:\n\nA. STORED INVOICE BILLS TABLE:\n- Display a table listing all saved bills:\n  * Columns: Date, Invoice No., Supplier Name, GSTIN, Taxable Subtotal, CGST, SGST, IGST, Verified Total, Actions (View / Delete).\n  * Summary Bar across all stored bills:\n    - Total Bills Verified: N\n    - Total Purchase Expenditure (Cost of Goods): ₹[Sum of Subtotals]\n    - Total Claimable GST ITC: ₹[Sum of CGST + SGST + IGST]\n\nB. AGGREGATED GST ITC LEDGER (GSTR-3B PREPARATION):\n- Total Eligible Input Tax Credit accumulated from stored bills:\n  * CGST Pool: ₹[Total CGST]\n  * SGST Pool: ₹[Total SGST]\n  * IGST Pool: ₹[Total IGST]\n- Statutory Compliance Check:\n  * Flags any stored bill with missing/invalid supplier GSTINs.\n  * Reminder: 180-day vendor payment timeline to claim ITC under Section 16.\n\nC. CUSTOMIZABLE ANNUAL BUSINESS & ITR CALCULATOR (ITR-4 / ITR-3):\n- Interactive Inputs:\n  * Annual Gross Sales / Turnover (₹) [Input field, e.g. default ₹30,00,000]\n  * Mode Toggle: [Presumptive Sec 44AD (ITR-4)] vs [Normal P&L (ITR-3)]\n- If Sec 44AD selected:\n  * Digital Receipts (UPI/Bank) % slider (Default 80%)\n  * Profit rates: 6% for Digital, 8% for Cash (customizable)\n  * Deemed Business Net Profit = (Digital Sales × 6%) + (Cash Sales × 8%)\n- If Normal P&L (ITR-3) selected:\n  * Purchase Costs: Auto-populated from the [Total Purchase Expenditure] of all saved bills (editable).\n  * Other Operating Expenses (Rent, Electricity, Salaries) (₹) [Input field]\n  * Net Profit = Gross Sales - (Purchase Costs + Operating Expenses)\n- Live Tax Liability Summary:\n  * Slabs under New Tax Regime (FY 2025-26 / 2026-27)\n  * Section 87A rebate evaluation (Displays \"₹0 Tax Payable\" if within rebate ceiling)\n  * Tax Audit applicability check under Section 44AB\n\nD. DATA MANAGEMENT:\n- [📥 Export Consolidated Tax & ITC Summary (CSV / PDF)]\n- [🗑️ Clear All Stored Bills]\n\nGUARDRAIL:\nDo not alter the OCR extraction logic, reverse-token parser, or table math calculations in Tab 1. Simply wire the verified bill data to persist into the Tab 2 ledger upon clicking \"[💾 Save Bill to Tax Ledger]\".\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-11-03T14:02:22+05:30.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
